   "source": [
    "`HAVING`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9c20db46",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Проводится группировка, агрегация и применяется фильтр\n",
    "```\n",
    "SELECT\n",
    "    type1 AS primary_tipe\n",
    "    AVG(attack) AS avg_attack\n",
    "FROM sql.pokemon\n",
    "GROUP BY primary_type\n",
    "HAVING AVG(attack) > 90\n",
    "```"
   ]
  }
